##grflangid 0x01

STR_GRF_NAME :Fairy's UK Set (NG)
STR_GRF_DESC :UKRS2, rewritten in NML, with some extra content, and it runs on Narrow Gauge. Original GRF and it's contents by {GOLD}PikkaBird{BLACK}. Extra thanks to the {GOLD}RUKTS{BLACK} Team for letting me make use some of their work. Their NML Patcher made compiling things a lot easier for me.

STR_NO_COUPLE_MU:You may only couple this train to an "MU Coach", or another train of the same type!
STR_NO_COUPLE_MU_ONLY:You may only couple this train to an "MU Coach"!
STR_NO_COUPLE:You may not couple anything to this train!
STR_NO_COUPLE_SAME:You may only couple this train to another train of the same type!
STR_CANNOT_START:This train is too long/short to start!

STR_NAME_WAGON_TENDER:Tender
STR_NAME_WAGON_MU_COACH:MU Coach

